<title>UK: Canadian Wheat Board sets NZ$100 mln one-year bond.</title>
<headline>Canadian Wheat Board sets NZ$100 mln one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto-Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CANADIAN WHEAT BOARD</p>
<p> AMT     NZ$100 MLN   COUPON     7.50	MATURITY    21.NOV.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.985   PAY DATE    21.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA+   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    MANITOBA  HOME CTRY  CANADA</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.875</p>
<p> NOTES    **US/UK/NZ/DE/JP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
